This repository (https://packages.tamkungz.me) is a package hosting repository. It provides
packages, release files, repository metadata and related files for download and installation,
for example through apt, dnf, apk, xbps, pacman, Maven, Gradle and winget.

1. Packages and projects

   Projects and packages published here may have their own licenses. The license of each project
   applies to that project's source code, binaries, packages and other artifacts, as specified by
   that license. Publishing a project through this repository does not replace or change the
   project's own license.

   If a package does not state a license of its own (for example in its POM, documentation or
   project page), all rights in it are reserved by its author.

2. Use

   You may download artifacts from this repository with package managers and dependency managers
   for the purpose of installing, building, testing or running software, within the license of the
   package concerned.

3. Mirroring

   Official distribution repositories and established community package repositories may mirror
   packages from this repository when permitted by the applicable project license.

   Do not create unofficial personal mirrors, PPAs, Launchpad repositories or independently hosted
   copies of this repository without permission.

   Mirroring does not transfer ownership of the packages, projects, repository metadata, names or
   branding.

4. Repository content

   The website, repository metadata, names and branding of TamKungZ_ Packages are
